Limitations: no oscilloscope/logic-analyzer capture; no direct IMU supply measurement; posture/load mode was not instrumented during the serial test. Correction on 2026-10-25 at 17:46 UTC+8: although the host error text says 60 ms, _read_status can exit on the first empty serial.read(1), approximately 20 ms with this configuration. These timeout counts do not establish a full 60 ms receive window. A later response may have been discarded by the next transaction. The successful diagnostic READ helper retries, so it is not a raw single-attempt success-rate measurement. No registers were written and no firmware or wiring was changed.
